  "description": "<p>From Nottingham, based in Manchester, Sharkcave was envisaged by a group of friends looking to design and produce luxury clothing in the late stages of 2020.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are looking for partners to help grow awareness for our premium products, and to assist us in becoming established within the industry.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>To begin with, we are looking for individuals looking to make 5% in commision from any sales purchased through their personal Sharkcave link. As we sell a high end product, our prices are reflective of that, meaning although comission may appear slim, the opportunity to make substantial money is high.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>All of our partners will also be given a personal 10% discount code for their own use, alongside free delivery.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As we are only in the early stages of our development, we hope to see bigger benefits and opportunities for our partners in the future.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We hope to work with you soon, @sharkcave.&nbsp;</p>",
